---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Home" description="The personal site of Tyler Kleint: photographs, writing, and work.">
  <section class="wrapper hero page-intro">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Personal archive / 2026</p>
      <h1>Looking closely at ordinary things.</h1>
      <a class="section-link" href="/photography">Enter the photographs ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">
      <strong>A place for work in progress.</strong>
      <p>Photographs, notes, and a record of the things I’m learning to make.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrapper content-grid">
    <div>Now</div>
    <div><p>I’m rebuilding this site from the ground up as a small, thoughtful web project. The first version is intentionally quiet: good type, clear pages, and room to grow.</p></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
